      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Android 手机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another operation is still running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一个操作仍在进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another operation is still running. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另一个操作仍在进行，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any Ubuntu, Debian, AlmaLinux, Rocky, CentOS or Fedora server you can SSH into with a key. Fresh servers get OpenVPN and WireGuard installed in the next step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任何能用密钥通过 SSH 登录的 Ubuntu、Debian、AlmaLinux、Rocky、CentOS 或 Fedora 服务器。全新的服务器会在下一步安装 OpenVPN 和 WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks for Face ID (or your passcode) when VPN Sync opens. Your servers' keys stay in this iPhone's Keychain either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 VPN Sync 时要求面容 ID（或密码）。无论是否开启，你的服务器密钥都保存在这台 iPhone 的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At %lld%% of a limit you get a banner, an Activity entry, and the device's meter turns orange.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用量达到限额的 %lld%% 时，你会收到横幅通知和一条动态记录，设备的用量条也会变成橙色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At most 50 devices at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次最多 50 台设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
