    "Builds up day by day from the server's own counter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据服务器自己的计数器逐日累计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built into macOS, iOS, Windows and Android, no app needed. Uses hwdsl2's setup-ipsec-vpn in IKEv2-only mode; every device gets an IKEv2 profile. Open UDP 500 and 4500 in the server's firewall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS、iOS、Windows 和 Android 内置支持，无需安装应用。使用 hwdsl2 的 setup-ipsec-vpn（仅 IKEv2 模式）；每台设备都会得到一个 IKEv2 配置文件。请在服务器防火墙中开放 UDP 500 和 4500。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
