          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download and upload speed of this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备的下载和上传速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download this month": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each server counts every device's data every minute, even while this Mac is off. A pausing limit blocks the device's traffic on the server until midnight (daily) or the 1st (monthly); the device stays connected and nothing is revoked. Days follow this Mac's time zone (%@), which is sent to the server when you save a limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每台服务器每分钟统计每台设备的流量，即使这台 Mac 关机也一样。会暂停的限额会在服务器上阻断设备的流量，直到午夜（每日）或下月 1 日（每月）；设备保持连接，也不会吊销任何东西。日期按这台 Mac 的时区（%@）计算，保存限额时会把时区发送给服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Server…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑服务器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Usage Limit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑流量限额…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter its current public IP from your provider's console. With Lightsail access set up, VPN Sync finds new IPs on its own. If this Mac is connected to %@'s VPN, disconnect it first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在服务商的控制台查看它当前的公网 IP 并填在这里。设置好 Lightsail 访问后，VPN Sync 会自己找到新 IP。如果这台 Mac 正连着 %@ 的 VPN，请先断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the daily limit as a number, e.g. 2 or 1.5.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入每日限额的数字，例如 2 或 1.5。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the monthly limit as a number, e.g. 50.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入每月限额的数字，例如 50。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device connected through %@ is disconnected and can't reconnect until you start it again. It also starts again automatically if the server reboots. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Every device connected through %1$@ is disconnected and can't reconnect until you start it again. It also starts again automatically if the server reboots. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 %1$@ 连接的所有设备都会断开，在你重新启动它之前无法重连。服务器重启时它也会自动启动。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device is disconnected for about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有设备会断开大约一分钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device on %@ already has a limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 上的每台设备都已经有限额"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every device on %@ is disconnected for about a minute while it restarts. The IP address stays the same. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Every device on %1$@ is disconnected for about a minute while it restarts. The IP address stays the same. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ 重启时，所有设备会断开大约一分钟。IP 地址保持不变。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every profile uses %@. From the next check on, devices added, removed or given new profiles are listed here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有配置文件都使用 %@。从下次检查开始，新增、移除或换发了配置文件的设备会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every profile uses %@; no device was added, removed or given a new profile since your last check.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有配置文件都使用 %@；自上次检查以来，没有设备被添加、移除或换发配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything is installed. Running setup again updates the server tools and keeps all VPN settings and devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有组件都已安装。再次运行配置会更新服务器工具，并保留所有 VPN 设置和设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export for iPhone…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为 iPhone 导出…"
          }
