    "IKEv2 for Android (strongSwan)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于 Android 的 IKEv2（strongSwan）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IKEv2 for Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于 Windows 的 IKEv2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IKEv2 for iPhone, iPad and Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于 iPhone、iPad 和 Mac 的 IKEv2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IP or hostname": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IP 或主机名"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IPsec/IKEv2": {},
    "If it was stopped and started, its IP may have changed. Add Lightsail access in VPN Sync Settings so it's found automatically, or enter the new IP in VPN Sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果它被停止后又启动过，IP 可能已经变了。在 VPN Sync 设置中添加 Lightsail 访问，就能自动找到；或者在 VPN Sync 中填入新 IP。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the server was rebuilt it has a new SSH key and VPN Sync will refuse to connect. Fetch and trust the new one here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果服务器被重建过，它会有新的 SSH 密钥，VPN Sync 会拒绝连接。在这里获取并信任新的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this Mac is connected through it, it loses internet until the VPN is back (or you disconnect the VPN app).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果这台 Mac 正通过它上网，在 VPN 恢复（或你断开 VPN 应用）之前会无法上网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import OpenVPN Profile on This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上导入 OpenVPN 配置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Servers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Servers…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入服务器…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import WireGuard Profile on This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上导入 WireGuard 配置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported %lld servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入 %lld 台服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported 1 server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入 1 台服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %@, out %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "In %1$@, out %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "入站 %1$@，出站 %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In WireGuard tap + → Create from QR code.\nThis code contains the device's private key; don't share it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 WireGuard 中点 + → 通过二维码创建。\n这个二维码包含设备的私钥，请不要分享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include the Lightsail key": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含 Lightsail 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes each server's private key. Anyone with the file and the passphrase can log in to these servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含每台服务器的私钥。任何拿到这个文件和口令的人都能登录这些服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install IKEv2 Profile on This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在这台 Mac 上安装 IKEv2 配置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install OpenVPN": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 OpenVPN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install WireGuard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装 WireGuard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install or repair OpenVPN, WireGuard and the server tools": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装或修复 OpenVPN、WireGuard 和服务器工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed VPNs keep their port. Change it here to move them; every profile is updated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装的 VPN 保持原端口。在这里更改即可迁移，所有配置文件都会更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed with a free Apple ID, VPN Sync has to be reinstalled from Xcode every 7 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用免费 Apple ID 安装时，VPN Sync 每 7 天需要用 Xcode 重新安装一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installing… a fresh OpenVPN or IPsec install takes a few minutes. Keep this window open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在安装…全新安装 OpenVPN 或 IPsec 需要几分钟。请保持这个窗口打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs the server tools, plus OpenVPN and WireGuard if they're missing. Existing setups are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装服务器工具；如果缺少 OpenVPN 和 WireGuard，也会一并安装。现有配置会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will be paused at 100%.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "达到 100% 时会暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's booting; live monitoring reconnects when it's ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动；准备好后实时监控会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's booting; this reconnects when it's ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在启动；准备好后会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its Desktop folder is renamed too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的桌面文件夹也会改名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its Desktop folder is renamed too. Devices and the server itself aren't affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的桌面文件夹也会改名。设备和服务器本身不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its profiles stop working on every VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的配置文件会在所有 VPN 上失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its profiles were copied to your Desktop. Make sure the VPN ports are open in the server's firewall (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的配置文件已复制到桌面。请确认服务器防火墙已开放 VPN 端口（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its profiles were copied to your Desktop. VPN Sync opened its ports in the Lightsail firewall where the key allows it (%@); the output says if any need opening by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的配置文件已复制到桌面。VPN Sync 已在密钥允许的范围内为它在 Lightsail 防火墙中开放端口（%@）；如有需要手动开放的端口，输出中会说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its static IP stays the same.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的静态 IP 保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps one SSH connection open to each server to show who is connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与每台服务器保持一条 SSH 连接，用来显示谁在线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key removed from the Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已从钥匙串中删除密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
