          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后在线 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last seen at %@. Change it here when the server's IP changes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后一次是 %@。服务器的 IP 变了时，在这里更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets the iPhone stop and start your Lightsail servers. The key goes into the encrypted file and then the iPhone's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让 iPhone 可以停止和启动你的 Lightsail 服务器。密钥会放进加密文件，然后存入 iPhone 的钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
