        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Next to the device count: a pause mark with how many devices are paused, or a gauge when one is at the warning level.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备数量旁边：有设备暂停时显示暂停标记和数量，有设备达到警告水平时显示仪表。"
          }
