          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@，来自 %2$@，%3$@ 起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Mac, open VPN Sync → Settings → iPhone, tick Include the Lightsail key, click Export for iPhone…, AirDrop the file to this iPhone and open it with VPN Sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上打开 VPN Sync → 设置 → iPhone，勾选“包含 Lightsail 密钥”，点“为 iPhone 导出…”，用隔空投送把文件发到这台 iPhone，再用 VPN Sync 打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Mac: VPN Sync Settings → iPhone → Export for iPhone…, then AirDrop the file here and open it with VPN Sync. Importing again updates the servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上：VPN Sync 设置 → iPhone → 为 iPhone 导出…，然后用隔空投送把文件发到这里，用 VPN Sync 打开。再次导入会更新服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One name per line (or separated by commas). Each device gets a profile for every VPN on %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行一个名称（或用逗号分隔）。每台设备都会得到 %@ 上每种 VPN 的配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more names, separated by commas, spaces or new lines. Each device gets a profile for every VPN on %@: OpenVPN, WireGuard and IKEv2.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个或多个名称，用逗号、空格或换行分隔。每台设备都会得到 %@ 上每种 VPN 的配置文件：OpenVPN、WireGuard 和 IKEv2。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One or more names, separated by commas, spaces or new lines. Each device gets a profile for every VPN on %@: OpenVPN, WireGuard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个或多个名称，用逗号、空格或换行分隔。每台设备都会得到 %@ 上每种 VPN 的配置文件：OpenVPN、WireGuard。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only Ed25519 keys are supported (this one is %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只支持 Ed25519 密钥（这个是 %@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only this iPhone forgets it, with its key. The server and its devices aren't touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有这台 iPhone 会忘记它和它的密钥。服务器和设备不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开"
          }
        }
      }
