    "Open System Settings → General → Device Management (Profiles) and install “%@”. Then connect from System Settings → VPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“系统设置 → 通用 → 设备管理（描述文件）”并安装“%@”。然后在“系统设置 → VPN”中连接。"
          }
