    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System resolvers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统解析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP": {},
    "TCP %@ is SSH's port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP %@ 是 SSH 的端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP 22 is SSH's port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP 22 是 SSH 的端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP 443 looks like normal HTTPS traffic and gets through most networks; WireGuard on UDP 443 is faster. Open the same ports in the server's firewall.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP 443 看起来像普通的 HTTPS 流量，能通过大多数网络；WireGuard 用 UDP 443 更快。请在服务器防火墙中开放同样的端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TCP 443 looks like normal HTTPS traffic and gets through most networks; WireGuard on UDP 443 is faster. VPN Sync opens the ports in the Lightsail firewall (the key needs the port permissions; Settings → Lightsail).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TCP 443 看起来像普通的 HTTPS 流量，能通过大多数网络；WireGuard 用 UDP 443 更快。VPN Sync 会在 Lightsail 防火墙中开放这些端口（密钥需要端口权限；见“设置 → Lightsail”）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电视"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Table installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据表已安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Table not downloaded yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据表尚未下载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That passphrase doesn't open this file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个口令打不开这个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Lightsail instance is shut down: every device is disconnected, and nothing reconnects until you start it again (Power → Start Server). %@ %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "The Lightsail instance is shut down: every device is disconnected, and nothing reconnects until you start it again (Power → Start Server). %1$@ %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lightsail 实例已关机：所有设备都已断开，在你重新启动它之前不会重连（电源 → 启动服务器）。%1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Lightsail instance isn't running, so no device can connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lightsail 实例没有运行，所以任何设备都无法连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Lightsail instance shuts down: every device is disconnected until you start it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lightsail 实例会关机：在你重新启动之前，所有设备都会断开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Lightsail instance shuts down: every device is disconnected until you start it again. Without a static IP it gets a new address when it starts; phones and TVs then need their WireGuard and IKEv2 profiles again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lightsail 实例会关机：在你重新启动之前，所有设备都会断开。没有静态 IP 时，它启动后会拿到新地址；手机和电视需要重新导入 WireGuard 和 IKEv2 配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac showed it when it exported the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 导出文件时显示过它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH user can't run sudo without a password. Use root or a user with passwordless sudo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 SSH 用户不能免密码运行 sudo。请使用 root 或可以免密码 sudo 的用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VPN Sync iPhone app connects to your servers over SSH itself, so it needs their addresses and keys. Export them to an encrypted file, AirDrop it to the iPhone, open it with VPN Sync and type the passphrase.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VPN Sync 的 iPhone 应用自己通过 SSH 连接你的服务器，所以需要它们的地址和密钥。把它们导出成一个加密文件，用隔空投送发到 iPhone，用 VPN Sync 打开并输入口令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection closed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key can read instance details and stop or start instances; it can't create, change or delete anything. To limit it to your VPN servers, replace * with their instance ARNs. Without the stop and start permissions, only the IP lookup works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个密钥可以读取实例信息、停止或启动实例；不能创建、更改或删除任何东西。如果只想让它管理你的 VPN 服务器，把 * 换成它们的实例 ARN。没有停止和启动权限时，只能查找 IP。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key file is damaged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥文件已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key for %@ is missing; import the servers again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缺少 %@ 的密钥；请重新导入服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key has a passphrase; use a key without one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个密钥设有口令；请使用没有口令的密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key isn't in OpenSSH format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个密钥不是 OpenSSH 格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live view stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时视图已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ports %@ listens on, and where each connected device comes from": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 监听的端口，以及每台已连接设备的来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profiles came back incomplete.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取到的配置文件不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profiles on your Desktop are out of date. Sync to update them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "桌面上的配置文件已过期。同步即可更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't accept the key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器不接受这个密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't answer in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器没有及时响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器现在是 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rewrites its profiles for %@ and restarts IPsec with a new certificate. Every device then needs its new profile: open it here and share it, or scan its QR code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器会按 %@ 重写配置文件，并用新证书重新启动 IPsec。之后每台设备都需要新的配置文件：在这里打开并分享，或扫描它的二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server rewrites its profiles for %@. Every device then needs its new profile: open it here and share it, or scan its QR code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器会按 %@ 重写配置文件。之后每台设备都需要新的配置文件：在这里打开并分享，或扫描它的二维码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server said no (exit %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了（退出码 %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's IP changed. Sync to update the profiles on your Desktop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器的 IP 变了。同步即可更新桌面上的配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's host key doesn't match the one VPN Sync trusts. Not connecting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器的主机密钥与 VPN Sync 信任的不一致。不会连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's public IP or hostname.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器的公网 IP 或主机名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trusted host key for this server is missing or damaged; export the servers from the Mac again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台服务器的可信主机密钥缺失或已损坏；请从 Mac 重新导出服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their OpenVPN certificates are revoked, WireGuard peers removed and IKEv2 certificates revoked. Their profiles stop working. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们的 OpenVPN 证书会被吊销，WireGuard 对端会被移除，IKEv2 证书也会被吊销。它们的配置文件将失效。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their OpenVPN certificates are revoked, WireGuard peers removed. Their profiles stop working. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们的 OpenVPN 证书会被吊销，WireGuard 对端会被移除。它们的配置文件将失效。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This AWS key isn't allowed to %@. Add lightsail:%@ to its policy (VPN Sync on the Mac: Settings → Lightsail).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This AWS key isn't allowed to %1$@. Add lightsail:%2$@ to its policy (VPN Sync on the Mac: Settings → Lightsail)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 AWS 密钥没有权限%1$@。请在它的策略中添加 lightsail:%2$@（在 Mac 上的 VPN Sync：设置 → Lightsail）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code holds the device's private key. Don't share it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个二维码包含设备的私钥，请不要分享。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is from a newer VPN Sync; update the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件来自更新版本的 VPN Sync；请更新应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone doesn't have the Lightsail key yet. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 还没有 Lightsail 密钥。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone doesn't know %@'s Lightsail details or have the Lightsail key yet. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This iPhone doesn't know %1$@'s Lightsail details or have the Lightsail key yet. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 还不知道 %1$@ 的 Lightsail 信息，也没有 Lightsail 密钥。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone doesn't know %@'s Lightsail details yet (it was imported before they were included). %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This iPhone doesn't know %1$@'s Lightsail details yet (it was imported before they were included). %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 还不知道 %1$@ 的 Lightsail 信息（导入时还没有包含这些信息）。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the fingerprint of %@'s SSH host key. VPN Sync will only ever talk to a server with this key. On a server you just created it's normally fine to accept; to be sure, compare it with the output of `ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub` on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 %@ 的 SSH 主机密钥指纹。VPN Sync 只会与持有这个密钥的服务器通信。刚创建的服务器通常可以直接接受；如果想确认，请把它与服务器上 `ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key.pub` 的输出比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a VPN Sync servers file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是 VPN Sync 的服务器文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This month: download %@, upload %@. Today: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "This month: download %1$@, upload %2$@. Today: %3$@."
