        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本月：下载 %1$@，上传 %2$@。今天：%3$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only removes it from this Mac: its settings, the copy of its key and its pinned host key. The server keeps running and its Desktop folder is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这只会把它从这台 Mac 中移除：它的设置、密钥副本和固定的主机密钥。服务器继续运行，桌面文件夹也会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This system isn't supported (needs apt or dnf).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不支持这个系统（需要 apt 或 dnf）。"
