    "WireGuard port must be 1–65535.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WireGuard 端口必须在 1–65535 之间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With an AWS key for Lightsail, VPN Sync can stop and start your servers (Power → Stop Server / Start Server, and Start in the menu bar), shows when one is stopped, and finds a server's new IP after a stop and start: it reconnects and updates the profiles on your Desktop on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有了 Lightsail 的 AWS 密钥，VPN Sync 就能停止和启动你的服务器（电源 → 停止服务器 / 启动服务器，以及菜单栏中的“启动”），显示哪台已停止，并在停止又启动后找到服务器的新 IP：它会自己重新连接并更新桌面上的配置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a static IP it gets a new address when it starts: VPN Sync finds it and updates the profiles, but phones and TVs need their WireGuard and IKEv2 profiles again. A Lightsail static IP avoids this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有静态 IP 时，它启动后会拿到新地址：VPN Sync 会找到它并更新配置文件，但手机和电视需要重新导入 WireGuard 和 IKEv2 配置文件。使用 Lightsail 静态 IP 可以避免这个问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
